<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένει-ον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένυς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>part covered by the beard, chin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.176
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιὸν γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.74
				</span></i>
			; esp. in supplication, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλλαβε χειρὶ γενείου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.371
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. χειρὶ παχείῃ ἁψάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.454
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενείου λευκήρη τρίχα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1056
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				666
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.36
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1277
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείρασθαι τὰ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			: prov. of a lean animal, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἄλλο
				πλὴν γ. τε καὶ κέρατα</span> nothing but <i>chin</i> and
			horns, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				902
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>beard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.117
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				6.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				11.5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.10.3
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.104H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> a lion's <i>mane</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>chaps</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				518b17
			</span></i>; <i>jaws,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.531
			</span></i> (Antip. Thess.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> pl., <i>teeth</i> of a saw, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).165.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i> (Dclos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
